WEBVTT

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:05.060
Lastly...

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.370
I, Student Council President Hadano Miki,

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.850
will announce our motto for this month.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:17.740
<b>Unnatural
Interspecies
 Relations</b>

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:17.120
"If you witness any unnatural 
interspecies relations, eradicate them."

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.020
It seems some students among us

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:24.100
have recently formed a group 
that violates natural law.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.580
Everyone...

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:29.250
Let us all live upright lives in 
accordance with the morals of nature.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.590
That is all.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.380
<i>That's a pretty decent thing 
to say, for an animal.</i>

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:52.050
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.050
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.630
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:23.640
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:08.960
What?!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.480
<b>Seton Academy Record 3       Those Who Strip with the Ones They Love</b>

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.480
<i>You</i> ran into <i>me</i>!

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.250
I finally got to take those off!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.790
Great job out there!

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.790
Student Council President!

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.970
<i>The naked mole-rat</i>

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.150
<i>is one of the very few species 
of eusocial mammals,</i>

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:40.180
<i>with a social structure similar to 
that of honeybees and termites.</i>

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.950
<i>They are born into specific roles in 
a hierarchy centering around a queen,</i>

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.680
<i>and these roles never change.</i>

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.290
Even if it's part of my job,

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:51.450
I hate that I have to wear 
clothes in front of others!

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:54.820
<b>* For naked mole-rats, wearing clothes is humiliating!</b>

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.820
You carried yourself with pride 
as our student council president!

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.080
You saw me with clothes on?!

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.430
W-We saw nothing!

00:02:58.430 --> 00:02:59.820
Right, guys?

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.930
We saw nothing! We saw nothing!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.370
So, what of the cooking club?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:09.750
Well, our research team went out 
in full force to investigate it.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.410
Good. Give your report at once.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.030
Right, then. Have a look at this.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:14.780
Action!

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.500
That's what you say when you're filming.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.510
<b>In the year 2020...</b>

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.510
<b>You will witness a miracle...</b>

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.510
<i>Moletarou-san! The truth is... I'm jobless!</i>

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.510
<b><i>Short-Lived Romance</i></b>

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.400
<i>Sorry, Molemi-san.</i>

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:28.970
<b><i>A Shocking 
Confession</i></b>

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.370
What is this?

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:28.970
<i>I am the angel Michael, 
and I've come from Heaven.</i>

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.970
A trailer for the movie I made.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:31.270
<i>Moletarou-san!</i>

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:31.270
<i>Molemi-san!</i>

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.490
I don't care about this! 
Show me the cooking club!

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.480
<b><i>What will come
 of their love...?</i></b>

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:32.480
Right!

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.300
First is Hino Hitomi, a human.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.980
She's the one who started 
the cooking club.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:43.280
What is the meaning of this obscene footage?!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.990
Next is Shishio Miyubi, a sloth.

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.150
She died.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.420
She seems to die a lot.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:53.300
She <i>dies</i> a lot?! Is she all right?!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.460
Next is Komori Yukari.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.550
She's a koala, and she was 
extremely cooperative.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.750
She allowed us to join her on her 
quest to find delicious food.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.550
<b>A Mysterious Flavor!</b>

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.550
<b>Pursuing the Legendary Fish, Surubí!</b>

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:11.100
<b>Seton Special
A Mysterious Flavor!
Pursuing the
 Legendary Fish, Surubí!</b>

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.850
<i>There it is!</i>

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.100
<i>A surubí! A surubí!</i>

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:27.120
<b>Seton Special
A Mysterious Flavor!
Pursuing the
 Legendary Fish, Surubí!</b>

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:20.880
Q. Why are you searching for delicious food?

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:17.010
<i>I just don't understand why</i>

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:21.250
<i>I've had to eat nothing but 
eucalyptus since I was a child.</i>

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:27.120
Q. What's the most delicious thing you've ever eaten?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.120
<i>My mom's po—</i>

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.620
<b>The End</b>

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:31.650
That's it.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:32.790
That's the end?!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.500
The club also has a ghost 
member named Nekomai Kurumi,

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.000
but unfortunately, she's a cat.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.010
A cat, eh? Then I suppose 
you couldn't help it.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.140
Wait, that's not the point!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.670
The cat aside, what I want to know

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.100
is how this indiscreet grouping 
of students was formed!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.030
What about Mazama Jin and the wolf 
Ranka, the ones at the center of it?

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:58.060
We filmed them, but I feel the shock 
would be too great for you.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.570
I don't need your consideration!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:03.980
I have a responsibility to protect this school!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:04.950
Right...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.890
<i>Jin! Jin! Jin! Jin! Jin!</i>

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:08.950
<i>Jin!</i>

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.940
President!

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:13.830
I understand now.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.540
The source of all these 
evils is, indeed, Mazama Jin.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.580
This man... This man...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.800
is trying to set himself up 
with a multi-species harem!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.420
I will stop you from achieving 
your ambition at any cost!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.650
All of you, go out and gather 
evidence of his evildoing!

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.930
Right away!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.430
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.430
That's it. Don't move the knife 
too far from your fingers.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.370
L-Like this?

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.890
You're doing great!

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:41.940
Aw... Only because you're 
so good at teaching.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.770
Really?

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:46.040
<i>Spending every day after school doing 
club stuff with Hino-san...</i>

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.210
Yeah, really!

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.040
Thanks!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.790
<i>The cooking club is the best!</i>

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.500
<i>The animals aren't here yet, either.</i>

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:52.450
<i>That's right... Lick, lick, lick, lick...</i>

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.280
What the hell are you doing, you dumb dog?!

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:59.040
That's how you say hello in 
a pack! No defying your boss!

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:00.840
How many times have I told you?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.390
You may be the boss of the pack,

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.010
but the most important one in the 
cooking club is the president, Hino-sa—

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.510
Once again, what the hell are you doing?!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.140
I've kinda gotten used to it.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.140
Don't get used to that!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.490
Get off of her!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.190
Is there a human named Mazama Jin in here?

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.820
Huh? Who are all of you?

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:23.570
So you're Mazama Jin, huh?

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.410
You're coming with us.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.760
Hold it! Jin is my partner!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:32.910
Partner?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.810
Yes!

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.410
No!

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.510
Might as well take her, too.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.340
Okay, we're here.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:46.780
<i>The lion.</i>

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.510
<i>With the fullest mane
of all the species on Earth,</i>

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.460
<i>and his tendency to live 
in harems known as prides,</i>

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.930
<i>he is the king of beasts.</i>

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.490
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:59.940
<i>Naked mole-rat!</i>

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.750
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.300
<i>Lion!</i>

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:09.190
I am Shishino King. Welcome, human.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.450
"Welcome," my ass! You're the 
one who had me dragged—

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.070
You're a bad guy!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.300
Keep your hands off of Jin!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.200
I don't know what you wan—

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.320
If you want Jin, you'll have to fight me!

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.580
You be quiet!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.500
Silence!

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.500
You're in the presence of the boss!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.620
It's all right. Let him go.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:27.750
Yes, sir.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.050
It seems I was right about 
what kind of male you are.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.220
Follow me. Let's go!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:43.270
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.640
You're going just like that?

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.270
Ouch. I'm stuck.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.660
Ouch! That hurts! Back up!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:45.870
Back up for a second!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.780
Over there.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:57.950
<i>The impala.</i>

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.490
<i>A herbivore of the bovine family 
that inhabits savannas.</i>

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:05.130
<i>It can jump as high as three 
meters and as far as ten meters.</i>

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.790
Twenty-five meters!

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.360
You're amazing, Shiho!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:11.350
You just keep beating your own record.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.220
Not bad, I guess.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.220
And?

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.590
What's the big deal about that impala?

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.390
Well... that impala, Shiho-dono, is...

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.550
my desired partner!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:21.230
Huh?!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.500
Hang on! You're a lion!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.350
Indeed.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.860
Which is why I wanted your advice.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.580
As the only two at this school

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.040
who have a partnership that 
surpasses the boundary of species,

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.140
you are the only ones I can ask.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:33.330
Um...

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.740
J-Jin...

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.890
He's a good guy!

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:37.870
Shut up.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.040
To hell with all this. Do whatever you want.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.300
You cannot leave.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.950
There is no escape from my harem!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.290
<b>* In a lion pride, 
the females generally do all the hunting</b>

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.290
Jin!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.670
I beg of you!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.130
Give me advice!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.120
You think...

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:55.840
this is any way to...

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.140
ask for a favor?!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:02.890
Now, I ask you once again.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:06.540
But didn't the student 
council president just say

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.650
she'd be cracking down on unnatural 
interspecies relations?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:12.900
Don't you think the student council's 
eyes are gonna be everywhere now?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.340
Gulp!

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.580
My feelings arose naturally, 
from within my own heart!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:21.640
Even if we are of different species, 
it would not be unnatural!

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.410
Is that not true for the two of you?!

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.380
First of all, tell me what 
made you fall for her.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.130
Well, it happened during 
lunch break a few days ago.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:38.820
While I was hungrily waiting for my 
harem to acquire my lunch for me...

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.460
It was love at first sight.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.270
That was just hunger.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.710
It was not!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:56.080
When I look at her, I feel 
I am no longer myself...

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.820
My heart races, unrestrained!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.710
Yeah, like I said, that's hunger!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:00.540
Hey.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.590
Have you told her how you feel?

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.860
Asking her to be your mate out of the 
blue would put her in a tight spot.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:09.670
Says the one who asked me to 
join her pack out of the blue!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:14.050
Of course, I have attempted 
to tell her several times.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.180
There is no escape from my harem!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.810
Go to her yourself!

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:25.360
Me? Myself?!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.560
Obviously!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:30.860
Damn. I don't know how you managed 
to get yourself a harem.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:31.860
How else?

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:36.360
In a pride of lions, the king has but one job...

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:40.110
To accept challenges from rivals 
seeking to take his harem,

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.780
and defeat them! Nothing more!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.660
What a boss!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.100
So basically...

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.410
You girls are here because you're 
attracted to his strength?

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.360
Well, that's part of it.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.810
Yeah, but...

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.410
His mane is just so hot!

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:56.880
Exactly!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.130
<i>The bigger and blacker a lion's mane is,
 the more attractive he is to lionesses.</i>

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>Even if a male risks his 
life to take over a harem,</i>

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:08.020
<i>if his mane is too sparse, 
the pride might simply disband!</i>

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.350
Anyway!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.240
Letting your women handle everything 
is out of the question!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:14.270
Go see her yourself and tell her how you feel!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.270
R-Right...

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:21.690
I wonder if things will work 
out okay for that lion.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:23.270
No way in hell they will.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.510
So then...

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.720
<b>* He's trying to approach her to talk</b>

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:49.220
<b>* He's trying to approach her to talk</b>

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.160
They're a carnivore and an herbivore.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.740
How that's going to end up is a no-brainer.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:05.610
It just means two animals of different 
species can never be a couple.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.270
Cut it out!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.750
Just give up.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.650
There's nothing more we can do for you.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.010
We male lions...

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.240
are chased out of our prides at 
the age of two, per our laws.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:29.010
The same happened to me.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.930
But even at that time,

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:35.020
I didn't feel the way I do now.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.330
What is...

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:39.620
What is this feeling called?

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.430
<i>I didn't realize he was that serious about her.</i>

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.940
Jin, I feel really bad for him.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.540
Yeah, but, I mean...

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.010
King! I challenge you!

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.450
Is he here to take your harem?

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:07.540
You are simply incorrigible.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.350
You have no chance of defeating me.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.720
Look who I've got!

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:16.230
King, you seem awfully 
infatuated with this impala.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.440
What are you doing to Shiho-dono?!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:21.620
Whoa, there. Try anything hasty...

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.280
And I think you know what'll happen.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.150
You coward! And you call yourself a lion?!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.340
Shut up! This is my idea of 
survival of the fittest!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.540
If you want her back, give your harem to me!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.820
Females are not mere objects to be given away!

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.450
Yeah! Yeah!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.270
You puny-maned wimp!

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.550
Puny! Puny!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:41.550
Stop saying "puny"!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.420
What are we gonna do, Jin?!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.510
Well, what are we supposed to do?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.540
Come, my brothers!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.870
Get him!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:52.930
King!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.060
That's dirty!

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.980
Jin! Do something!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:58.020
Just what do you expect me to do?!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.860
Once your harem belongs to me,

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.780
maybe I'll eat this impala to celebrate!

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:24.350
Whoa, hang on! Don't you 
care what happens to her?!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:30.300
I'll really do it! Y-You hear me?! I'll do it!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.930
In that case...

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.770
J-Just kidding! Just kidding!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.850
It was a joke! I'm sorry! 
I won't do it again!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.360
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, 
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sor—

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:52.410
Now my harem will leave me.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.940
Do not involve her in this any further.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:57.460
Bye, King.

00:14:57.460 --> 00:14:59.130
Let us know when your mane grows back.

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.540
They really did leave him!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.800
That's a good look for you!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.760
Perfect for the kind of guy 
who falls for an impa—

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:15.970
I apologize for chasing you around so much.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.650
I only wanted to speak to you.

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.610
I'm sorry you were dragged into our fight.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:27.810
Wait!

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:30.730
Um...

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.860
What did you want to talk about?

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:38.390
I... I wish to...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:43.000
t-to be your partner, Shiho-dono!

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.540
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:52.550
I'm, um... not in... h-heat right now.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:55.550
But...

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:59.510
I mean... well...

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:02.940
I-If we can start by just being friends...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.390
Huh?!

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:05.940
G-Gladly!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.420
I-I'm glad, too.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.940
Um... so...

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:13.080
Isn't that nice, Jin?

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.700
In the end, we didn't even do anything.

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.770
<i>I never thought it would actually work out.</i>

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.260
<i>Relationships between different animals, huh?</i>

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.220
What is it?

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.430
Nothing.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.180
I understand.

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.340
This is undeniable proof.

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:47.050
Mazama Jin is not only in an unnatural 
interspecies relationship himself,

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.680
but is manipulating other students 
into doing the same!

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.190
The cooking club...

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.730
will be disbanded immediately!

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.030
Tomorrow, after school,

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.530
tell Mazama Jin to come here!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:00.820
Right!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.330
What? He refused?!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.270
Yes. We told him to respond 
to your summons, but...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.590
I'm busy cooking with Hino-san right now.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:18.860
Why should I have to go see some stupid rat?!

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:21.810
That was how it ended.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.430
Then I have no choice.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:28.060
I'll just have to... put clothes on!

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.070
Hi, Hadano-san!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.340
It's Miki-san!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:39.130
We don't see you above ground too often.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.620
Your face is red. Are you okay?

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:45.390
<i>They're seeing me up close in all my shame!</i>

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.290
<i>Augh! I wanna strip! I wanna strip!</i>

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.800
<i>How can they all just walk around like that?!</i>

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.990
I-I'm sorry. I'm in a hurry, 
so I'll be going now.

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.050
What's the matter?

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.810
A c-cat!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.140
Oh, no... What do we do?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.800
Don't worry about us! Get away, Prez!

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.810
Her eyes...

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.900
She intends to toy with us, and then kill us!

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.900
<b>* Cats hunt rodents not just to eat, but also for pleasure</b>

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.320
That's insane! There's no way you can...

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.610
No...

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.290
This is our job.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.280
<b>* Naked mole-rats'
 roles are determined from birth</b>

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.460
You guys...

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:24.240
<i>In the naked mole-rats' eusocial society,</i>

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:28.390
<i>the most important job of 
all is to protect the nest.</i>

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.610
<i>If natural enemies attempt 
to infiltrate their nest,</i>

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.280
<i>they immediately assemble 
to block its entrance.</i>

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.260
<i>And then...</i>

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.080
<i>They are eaten, one by one!</i>

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.080
President! Run while you can!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:42.260
No! I can't leave you here!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.760
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.520
I've finally found you...

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:53.650
You pervert!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.740
<i>What is this pervert doing?!</i>

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.270
Mazama Jin-kun...

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.870
I know that you're trying to 
create a multi-species harem.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:07.290
Such a disorderly gathering will only 
bring chaos to our school's ecosystem.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.330
Huh?

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:12.580
If you acknowledge your error right now 
and swear to turn over a new leaf,

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.270
I will not punish you with suspension.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:18.800
There's nothing to acknowledge! 
I'm not creating a harem!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.840
Hey, Jin-dono!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.930
To thank you for your help, I will give 
you some tips on handling a harem!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.080
There! See?!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.560
Get out of here!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.940
I was right. This is a multi-species harem.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:31.370
As of today, the cooking club is disbanded!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.020
Wha—

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.400
Wait, please!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:37.080
We're only trying to take our 
club activities seriously!

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:40.650
They only joined because 
Jin-kun and I invited them.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.030
I think there's been some kind of mistake!

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.680
Is that so?

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:48.090
If a model student such as yourself says so,

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:50.040
I can't force you to disband.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:54.040
Then, as proof that you do 
not have wicked intentions,

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.130
you must kick any non-human 
members out of the club!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.700
How does that sound?

00:19:58.700 --> 00:19:59.720
That's...

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.850
Please, tell me more.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.050
Jin-kun!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.670
Wait, President!

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.180
You guys!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.650
Ranka-san here saved our lives!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:12.310
Kurumi said she was just playing.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.250
President!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.650
Please reconsider your punishment 
of the cooking club!

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:19.610
What are you talking about?

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.970
We heard that Ranka-san

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:26.120
only joined this club because she 
believed she could make friends

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.620
with animals of other species.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.620
Friends?

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:32.750
Yeah! And also because the food is yummy!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.810
Hi, everyone!

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.670
I came up with a new dish to make today!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.380
Yukari! Miyubi!

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:41.380
President...

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.790
These people do not seem unnatural to me.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.570
After living underground so long,

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:51.640
perhaps even our sense of 
values has grown narrow.

00:20:53.130 --> 00:20:56.560
Forgive me for speaking so brazenly to you.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:08.340
Out of respect to Ranka-san, 
I will leave for today.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.160
However, I will be observing 
you at all times.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.790
Keep that in mind.

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.430
So... what was that about, anyway?

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.930
That's what I want to know!

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:53.470
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.470
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:03.560
Today, as every day, we live for our King!

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:04.440
Meat: check!

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:06.690
Mane-grooming tools: check!

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:09.030
Good morning, King!

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:11.140
Ki...

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:12.160
...ng?

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:13.610
That's right!

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:16.750
Our King is no longer with us!

00:23:15.220 --> 00:23:18.160
<b>* They only 
liked King for his mane</b>

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:20.450
King...

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:24.290
King!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.940
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:26.610
<b>Miki here.</b>

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:28.360
<b>This school is becoming more and more unruly!</b>

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:29.570
<b>I am King.</b>

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:31.570
<b>This is happening because I stepped down.</b>

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:33.530
<b>Both inside and outside, the school is becoming a mess!</b>

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:34.280
<b>Next time,</b>

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:36.450
<b>"At Last, the Final Chapter! The Fall of Seton Academy, Part 1"!!</b>

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:38.540
<b>Are you sure about that, President?</b>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 4</b>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>The Self-Styled Young Man and the Giant Wolf</b>
